Elves and Orcs get a +1 bonus to hit and damage and an additional shot,
if they fire elven/orcish arrows from the respective bows - very nice,
but how dows one find sufficient amounts of racial arrows (even with
maxed luck, the blessed arrows disappear from time to time)? Normal
arrows are easy to get from arrow traps or mass-produced using the
longbow of diana, but what about racial arrows? Are there any other,
maybe more effective ways, than the following ones?

- kill elves/orcs and hope to find a few on their corpses
  -> negative side effect of lowering alignment, because they
  are normally generated peaceful for those who need them and
  will  hardly generate enough ammo.

- wish for arrows
  -> will produce no more than 20 per wish => not worth burning
  a wish for.

- collect/produce massive amounts of normal arrows, drop seperated
  stacks, then polypile
  -> maybe the most useful method - requires some luck and a wand
  of polymorph of course.

- hope to find some randomly generated ones
  -> no further comment.


